¦ Third Edition
W hen ä edition of Making a Good Script Gr eat  came out at ấ
of 1987, few screenwriting books had been published. I expected fairly new
writers to be the book’ s main readers, but soon learned that wasn’ t true. All
sorts of writers were using the book: Those who had never written ì
